title: Customer360 Agent Benchmark
message: If you use this benchmark, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Customer360 contributors
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
url: "https://github.com/Chr0nixz/Customer360"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Chr0nixz/Customer360"
abstract: >-
  A local, offline, auditable Agent benchmark over synthetic
  Customer360 data with a constrained SQL gateway. Public Dev
  and Private Hidden scores are reported separately;
  ranking_enabled is permanently false.
keywords:
